graph TD
    subgraph Build Process
        A[Developer Pushes Code to Repo] --> B(Trigger CI/CD Pipeline)
        B --> C{Code Analysis and Linting}
        C -- Pass --> D(Unit Tests)
        C -- Fail --> E[Notify Developer & Halt]
        D -- Pass --> F(Build Container Image)
        D -- Fail --> E
        F --> G{Image Build Successful?}
        G -- Yes --> H(Tag Image with Version and Commit SHA)
        G -- No --> E
        H --> I(Scan Image for Vulnerabilities)
    end

    subgraph Release Process
        I --> J{Vulnerability Scan: Critical Issues Found?}
        J -- Yes --> E
        J -- No --> K(Push Image to Container Registry)
        K --> L{Image Push Successful?}
        L -- Yes --> M(Update Release Metadata)
        L -- No --> E
        M --> N(Deploy to Staging Environment)
        N --> O{Staging: Integration Tests Pass?}
        O -- Yes --> P(Promote Image to Production)
        O -- No --> E
        P --> Q(Update Production Load Balancer)
        Q --> R[Release Complete!]
    end

   classDef error fill:#f9f,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px
   class E error